# homegrown-growthco - environment variables.
# Added 2026-10-11 (op #1253) so the deploy prerequisites are documented in the repo.
#
# The site itself reads NO runtime or build-time environment variables (no process.env or
# import.meta.env references in src/). NODE_VERSION is pinned in netlify.toml.
#
# GitHub Actions deploy (.github/workflows) needs two repo secrets:
#   NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN    personal access token from app.netlify.com > User settings > Applications
#   NETLIFY_SITE_ID       the site's API ID from Netlify > Site configuration > General
# Values live in the password-manager vault (see SECRET-INVENTORY.md at the workspace root).
